## 📖 Overview

A **Flask-powered web application** that delivers personalized meal recommendations based on each user's **dietary goals, preferences, and allergies**. Includes secure authentication, profile management, and automated nutrition reporting — all backed by **Backendless** cloud services.

> 🎯 **Goal:** Make healthy eating simple with smart, data-driven meal suggestions.

---

## ✨ Key Features

- 🥗 **Personalized meal suggestions** based on user goals
- 🚫 **Allergy-aware filtering** — safe recommendations only
- 🔐 **Secure authentication** via Backendless
- 👤 **User profile management** (goals, preferences, restrictions)
- 📊 **Calorie calculations** per meal and per day
- 📅 **Automated nutrition reports** — daily, weekly & monthly
- 📈 **Data persistence** in cloud backend
- 🎨 **Clean, responsive UI** with HTML5 + CSS3

